				<string name="Name">README</string>
				<ProtectedString name="Source">--[[

About the Place:

Was made for Rixty contest. Now open-source for everyone to enjoy.

How it works:

Each item has a script in it. The script changes the GUI to green and adds a StringValue for the
item to the player. This StringValue is vital because it will never get deleted so long as the player
is in the server.

The door checks to see if all 4 StringValues are present in the player. If yes, the player can enter.

Problems:

1. No security on the door.
2. People like to follow
3. Arcade machine likes to &quot;sink&quot; into the floor, giving away its position.
4. Launch stars may break soon.
5. Coin is very subtle. The only way to see it is to notice that its under the only plant that doesn&apos;t
    have studs
6. When player dies, the GUI resets back to grey. Can be fixed by checking if the StringValues
    exist when the player respawns.

Any others? PM me and we&apos;ll discuss.

--Briguy

]]

</ProtectedString>
				<bool name="archivable">true</bool>
			</Properties>
